---
title: Periodic elements
tags: tools
heading: "Elements"
summary: >-
    Converts element values from one property to another, such as atomic numbers to names or symbols.
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
    <p>Only some element properties can be converted. Separate values with spaces, commas, colons, semicolons or hyphens: they can be mixed, but they're needed. Values are matched ignoring case, so se, Se and SE all find selenium. The swap button turns the conversion round.</p>
    <p class="tool-about__credit">Data from <a href="https://github.com/Bowserinator/Periodic-Table-JSON" class="text-convrtr">Bowserinator / Periodic-Table-JSON</a>, under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/" class="text-convrtr">Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License</a>.</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Periodic elements", placeholder = "Example: 34,7,52,7,58 [Atomic number] → Se,N,Te,N,Ce") %}
<div class="elements-convert">
    <div class="input-group w-auto">
        <label class="input-group-text" for="elementPropFrom">From</label>
        <select class="form-select" id="elementPropFrom" autocomplete="off">
        <option value="symbol">Element symbol</option>
        <option value="name">Element name</option>
        <option value="number" selected>Atomic number</option>
        <option value="atomic_mass">Atomic mass</option>
        <option value="melt">Melting point</option>
        <option value="boil">Boiling point</option>
        </select>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-icon-text" id="elementPropSwap" aria-label="Swap from and to" title="Swap from and to"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
    <div class="input-group w-auto">
        <label class="input-group-text" for="elementPropTo">To</label>
        <select class="form-select" id="elementPropTo" autocomplete="off">
        <option value="symbol" selected>Element symbol</option>
        <option value="name">Element name</option>
        <option value="number">Atomic number</option>
        <option value="atomic_mass">Atomic mass</option>
        <option value="melt">Melting point</option>
        <option value="boil">Boiling point</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Run">Convert</button>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="form-check form-switch">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="removeDelimiters">
    <label class="form-check-label" for="removeDelimiters">Remove delimiters</label>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
